<title>USA: Sunrise Medical Inc Q1 net falls.</title>
<headline>Sunrise Medical Inc Q1 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>CARLSBAD, Calif. 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended</p>
<p>					     Sep 27, 1996   Sep 29, 1995</p>
<p> Net sales				     $165,353	$157,172</p>
<p> Cost of sales				  110,899	 102,472</p>
<p> Gross profit				    54,454	  54,700</p>
<p> Marketing, selling and admin expenses   37,270	  37,010</p>
<p> Research and development expenses	  3,759	   3,724</p>
<p> Corporate expenses			     2,994	   2,363</p>
<p>Amortization of goodwill and</p>
<p>  other intangibles			     2,040	   2,041</p>
<p> Corporate operating income		   8,391	   9,562</p>
<p>Other (expense) income:</p>
<p>     Interest expense			  (4,002)	 (3,530)</p>
<p>     Interest income and other, net	 1,494	     658</p>
<p> Income before taxes			    5,883	   6,690</p>
<p> Income tax provision			   2,823	   2,896</p>
<p> Net income					 3,060	   3,794</p>
<p> Earnings per share				0.16	    0.20</p>
<p> Weighted average shares outstanding     19,023	  19,147</p>
<p>(in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk, 212-859-1610</p>
